 (html isHtmlBlock)←ns ProcessFunctionCalls html;mask;ind;call;result;flag;isEmpty;txt;open;close;before;after;k
⍝ Executes all embedded function calls (⍎⍎name⍎⍎) in `html`, each exactly once, and puts their results in place.
⍝ Code is blanked rather than removed, so positions refer to `html` itself, and the calls are processed from
⍝ the last to the first: replacing one does not shift the positions of those that are still to come.
 isHtmlBlock←0
 txt←html
 mask←GetMaskForCodeTags html
 (mask/txt)←' '                                             ⍝ No calls inside code
 ind←'(?<!⍎)⍎⍎(?!⍎)'⎕S 0⊣txt                                 ⍝ 0-origin offsets of all "⍎⍎"
 :If 0≠≢ind←(2×⌊0.5×≢ind)↑ind                                ⍝ An unpaired last one is ignored
     ind←((≢ind)÷2)2⍴ind
     :For k :In ⌽⍳≢ind
         (open close)←ind[k;]                                ⍝ Offsets of the opening and the closing "⍎⍎"
         before←open↑html
         after←(close+2)↓html
         call←A.DLB A.DTB(open+2)↓close↑html
         result←ns ExecExternalFns call
         :If 0≠≢result
             isEmpty←0=≢¨result~¨' '
             result←(0⌈¯1++/∧\isEmpty)↓(-0⌈¯1++/∧\⌽isEmpty)↓result ⍝ Allow max 1 leading/trailing blank line
             flag←⊃ns.parms.syntaxSugar
             isHtmlBlock∨←CheckForHtmlBlock(⊆result)(0=≢¨' '~¨⍨⊆result)ns.topOfDocument
             :If 1=≡result
                 :If flag∧~isHtmlBlock
                     result←⊃ns ProcessInlineMarkUp result
                 :EndIf
             :Else
                 'Embeded function returned invalid result'⎕SIGNAL 11/⍨(,1)≢∪≡¨,¨result
                 :If flag∧~isHtmlBlock
                     result←,⊆result
                     result←,⊃¨ns ProcessInlineMarkUp¨A.DMB result
                 :EndIf
             :EndIf
             'Called function returned an HTML block but does not stand on its own'⎕SIGNAL 11/⍨isHtmlBlock∧0≠≢before,after
             :If (1<≡result)∧0=≢before,after                 ⍝ Several lines, and the call stands on its own
                 html←result
             :Else
                 :If 1<≡result                               ⍝ Several lines amid other text
                     result←⊃{⍺,' ',⍵}/result
                 :EndIf
                 html←before,result,after
             :EndIf
         :Else
             html←before,after                               ⍝ An empty result removes the call and nothing else
         :EndIf
     :EndFor
 :EndIf
